window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"warwick","b":"zaahen","win":["Skill","Warwick","Warwick","Skill","Skill","Warwick","Skill"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 2-3","text":"Jaws sustain plus Blood Hunt speed comes online and the trades are yours - once he drops low your chase makes disengaging impossible for him."},{"when":"Lvl 4-5","text":"His Q Darkin Glaive poke and E Golden Onslaught burst start punishing you before your healing ramps - shorten trades and keep E Primal Howl for his combo."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Coin-flip ultimates: your 1.5s Infinite Duress suppress against his R, which heals him for a portion of the damage it deals - whoever lands theirs first wins."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Lifesteal plus on-hit healing makes you the stronger sustained bruiser - force long fights now before his two-item rotation catches up."}],"wants":{"you":["Extended trades where Q healing compounds","Blood Hunt procs the moment he dips below half","R suppress landed before his R comes out"],"foe":["Q Darkin Glaive chip kept above your Blood Hunt line","E Golden Onslaught burst before your heals ramp","His R flipped out first in the level-6 window"]},"early":"Level 1 is plain farming before Q Jaws of the Beast and W Blood Hunt come online, then levels 2-3 belong to you: Jaws' bite-and-heal wins each exchange and the moment a trade puts him below half, Blood Hunt's speed turns your next engage into a run-down he cannot decline - press this window.","mid":"Levels 4-5 even out because his Q poke and E dash-burst hit before your sustain ramps, so trade in short bites with E Primal Howl ready. Level 6 is a true coin-flip: a landed Infinite Duress wins you the fight on the spot, but his R heals him for the damage it deals and flips any all-in he starts first.","late":"Your first item makes you the stronger sustained bruiser - lifesteal and on-hit healing grind him down in any long fight, so hunt duels then. Two items in it settles even: his Q resets and empowered E match your sustain blow for blow, and every sidelane meeting becomes a suppress-versus-R skill check.","whys":["Level 1 is even farm before your Q heal and W chase come online.","Level 2 is yours: Jaws of the Beast sustain and Blood Hunt speed win the trades.","Level 3 stays yours - Q lifesteal and W chase punish him once he drops low.","Levels 4-5 even out as his Q poke and E burst punish you before you ramp.","Level 6 is a coin-flip: your suppress against an R that heals him as it damages.","On your first item lifesteal and on-hit healing make you the stronger sustained bruiser.","Two items in it settles even - his Q resets and empowered E burst match your sustain in a skill-decided duel."]});
